# W3-C7 and C8 — Iris Found, and the Festival of Lanterns.
# The finale gets the double budget (CANON 15). Nobody done it. Everybody
# fixes it.

cut f_iris_found
  BG f_lantern
  MUSIC MOOD_SILENT
  FADE out 0.1
  WAIT 0.4
  FADE in 2.0
  MUSIC MOOD_SAD
  ACTOR you 220 544
  WAIT 1.2
  SAY you "The lantern room is smaller than the town thinks it is."
  MOVE you 420 540 2.4
  WAIT 1.6
  DOODLE prism 640 470 44
  SAY you "The Prism is in its cradle. Dark. And cracked, exactly the way her aunt's ledger said."
  WAIT 1.0
  ACTOR iris 760 536
  EMOTE iris worried
  SFX page
  SAY iris "...Is somebody there?"
  WAIT 0.8
  EMOTE iris sad
  SAY iris "I have been saying that for seven days. I have got quite good at it."
  MOVE you 620 538 2.0
  WAIT 2.0
  EMOTE you moved
  SAY you "Iris Marlow. The whole town has been looking for you."
  EMOTE iris shifty
  SAY iris "Have they. Well. That is mortifying."
  WAIT 0.8
  EMOTE iris moved
  SAY iris "I was going to be down in an hour. That was the plan. An hour, and nobody any the wiser."
  SAY you "That was a week ago."
  EMOTE iris sad
  SAY iris "...Yes."
  WAIT 1.2
  MUSIC MOOD_TOWER
  EXIT

cut f_festival
  BG ch5_green
  MUSIC MOOD_SILENT
  FADE out 1.0
  WAIT 1.2
  TITLE "The Festival of Lanterns" "for the first time in three years"
  FADE in 1.6
  WAIT 2.6
  MUSIC MOOD_FESTIVAL
  ACTOR nona 480 524
  ACTOR mayor 620 524
  ACTOR you 760 524
  ACTOR tansy 900 536
  EMOTE nona moved
  SAY nona "I have carried this match in my apron for three years."
  SFX sparkle
  DOODLE lantern 480 500 26
  SAY nona "Somebody light theirs off mine. That is the whole of the ceremony. That is all it ever was."
  WAIT 1.0
  SFX feather
  DOODLE lantern 620 496 26
  DOODLE lantern 760 502 26
  DOODLE lantern 900 498 26
  EMOTE mayor worried
  SAY mayor "Eleven. It was eleven, the last time. I have been counting since six o'clock."
  EMOTE tansy laughing
  SAY tansy "Count again! Count AGAIN!"
  WAIT 0.8
  EMOTE mayor moved
  SAY mayor "...Four hundred. And six. And a bird."
  WAIT 1.0
  DOODLE lantern 260 506 24
  DOODLE lantern 380 500 24
  DOODLE lantern 1040 504 24
  DOODLE lantern 1160 498 24
  DOODLE bird 700 300 30
  MOVE you 640 520 2.0
  SAY you "Up you go, then. All of you. She has been waiting a week."
  WAIT 1.6
  SFX mend
  SHAKE 5 0.8
  BLOOM 640 300 6
  WAIT 2.4
  HUE 6 1.0
  MUSIC MOOD_FESTIVAL
  SAY you "The Prism drinks it the way dry ground drinks rain."
  WAIT 1.4
  ACTOR iris 500 522
  EMOTE iris moved
  SAY iris "You could have done this any year. Any single year."
  EMOTE mayor sad
  SAY mayor "We know. We are very sorry. We are going to be tiresome about it for a while."
  EMOTE iris laughing
  SAY iris "Good."
  WAIT 1.2
  EMOTE nona moved
  SAY nona "Next year, Tinter. Say something next year. Anything at all. We will come."
  EMOTE iris moved
  SAY iris "...I will try. I am not promising I will be graceful about it."
  WAIT 1.6
  TITLE "Prismbrook" "in colour, and in a great deal of noise"
  WAIT 3.0
  SAY you "Nobody done it."
  SAY you "Everybody fixed it."
  WAIT 1.0
  SAY tansy "Also Pip is a Deputy Detective now. The Mayor said. Everyone HEARD him say it."
  EMOTE mayor laughing
  SAY mayor "I did say it. It is minuted. It is, I am told, now the law."
  WAIT 1.6
  FADE out 2.4
  WAIT 2.6
  EXIT
